---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import PostRow from '../../components/PostRow.astro';
import ContentFilter from '../../components/ContentFilter.astro';
import { postTopics } from '../../lib/topics';
const posts = (await getCollection('posts', p => !p.data.draft)).sort((a,b) => +b.data.date-+a.data.date);
const tags = [...new Set(posts.flatMap(postTopics))].sort();
---
<SiteLayout title="기술 글"><section class="container page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">WRITING</span><h1>배운 것보다,<br /><em>이해한 것을 남깁니다.</em></h1><p>프로젝트에서 마주한 문제와 구현 기록, 다시 꺼내 볼 개발 노트.</p></section><section class="container listing-section"><ContentFilter tags={tags} /><div class="post-list">{posts.map(post => <div data-filter-item data-tags={JSON.stringify(postTopics(post))} data-search={`${post.data.title} ${post.data.description} ${postTopics(post).join(' ')}`}><PostRow post={post} /></div>)}</div><p class="empty-state" data-filter-empty hidden>검색 결과가 없습니다. 다른 검색어를 입력하거나 전체 필터를 선택해 주세요.</p></section></SiteLayout>
